{"insertText":{"location":{"index":145113,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"text":"Table VII. Within-Dataset Performance of the Fixed-Recipe Models\nNote. Three-seed mean-logit ensembles, fixed recipe; thresholds frozen on source validation. ROC-AUC intervals: 95% percentile intervals from 5,000 stratified cluster-bootstrap draws, not adjusted for multiplicity. PR-AUC prevalence baselines: 0.500 (FF++, DFo), 0.862 (CDF). FPR = 1 − specificity; FNR = 1 − recall. Seed SD from three seeds is descriptive. Celeb-DF v2 intervals are approximate: all 843 fake videos lie in 9 identity clusters. Acc = accuracy; Prec = precision; Rec = recall; Spec = specificity; FP = false positives; FN = false negatives."}},
