{"updateTextStyle":{"range":{"startIndex":144665,"endIndex":144666,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"textStyle":{"fontSize":{"magnitude":12,"unit":"PT"}},"fields":"bold,italic,underline,backgroundColor,fontSize"}},
{"insertText":{"location":{"index":144577,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"text":"\nResults are reported according to the analysis plan in Chapter 3. An interim decision to present the BO-selected configuration as primary was reverted to the approved plan; all comparisons under both regimens are reported. The statistical procedures, including the changes made after test scoring, are described in Chapter 3 under Statistical Treatment of Data, and the original and corrected permutation tests are compared in Appendix J (Table J5). The rank-based correction removed one significant difference favoring SwinFusion++ (within DeeperForensics-1.0, against Video Swin-B) and added two (Celeb-DF v2 → FF++ C23 and DeeperForensics-1.0 → Celeb-DF v2, both against Swin-B)."}},
{"updateParagraphStyle":{"range":{"startIndex":144578,"endIndex":145261,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","alignment":"JUSTIFIED","lineSpacing":200,"indentFirstLine":{"magnitude":36,"unit":"PT"},"spaceAbove":{"magnitude":0,"unit":"PT"},"spaceBelow":{"magnitude":0,"unit":"PT"},"keepWithNext":false},"fields":"namedStyleType,alignment,lineSpacing,indentFirstLine,spaceAbove,spaceBelow,keepWithNext"}},
{"updateTextStyle":{"range":{"startIndex":144578,"endIndex":145260,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"textStyle":{"fontSize":{"magnitude":12,"unit":"PT"}},"fields":"bold,italic,underline,backgroundColor,fontSize"}},
{"updateTextStyle":{"range":{"startIndex":145260,"endIndex":145261,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"textStyle":{"fontSize":{"magnitude":12,"unit":"PT"}},"fields":"bold,italic,underline,backgroundColor,fontSize"}},
{"insertText":{"location":{"index":144577,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"text":"\nAll results come from held-out test videos that were not used for training, model selection, threshold selection, or calibration. Each model is the three-seed ensemble described in Chapter 3: a video’s score is the mean logit of its seven 16-frame clips, averaged over the three seeds, and the decision threshold and calibration temperature were fixed on source-validation videos before any test video was scored. Under cross-dataset transfer, the source-trained ensemble and its threshold were applied unchanged to the target dataset, and no target label was used for any decision. All results use the plain inference variant; results with horizontal-flip test-time augmentation are reported in Appendix J (Table J4)."}},
{"updateParagraphStyle":{"range":{"startIndex":144578,"endIndex":145297,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","alignment":"JUSTIFIED","lineSpacing":200,"indentFirstLine":{"magnitude":36,"unit":"PT"},"spaceAbove":{"magnitude":0,"unit":"PT"},"spaceBelow":{"magnitude":0,"unit":"PT"},"keepWithNext":false},"fields":"namedStyleType,alignment,lineSpacing,indentFirstLine,spaceAbove,spaceBelow,keepWithNext"}},
{"updateTextStyle":{"range":{"startIndex":144578,"endIndex":145296,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"textStyle":{"fontSize":{"magnitude":12,"unit":"PT"}},"fields":"bold,italic,underline,backgroundColor,fontSize"}},
{"updateTextStyle":{"range":{"startIndex":145296,"endIndex":145297,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"textStyle":{"fontSize":{"magnitude":12,"unit":"PT"}},"fields":"bold,italic,underline,backgroundColor,fontSize"}},
{"insertText":{"location":{"index":144577,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"text":"\nRQ1 asked: To what extent does SwinFusion++ improve video-level deepfake detection performance compared with standalone Swin Transformer and standalone Video Swin Transformer under in-distribution and cross-dataset evaluation, in terms of Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1-Score, and ROC-AUC? The principal evidence is the fixed-recipe comparison, in which Swin-B, Video Swin-B, and SwinFusion++ were trained with the identical recipe, so a difference between them is not due to unequal tuning. The BO-selected SwinFusion++ is reported afterward as a configured system with unequal optimization effort."}},
